674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ck8jK3spquYQ7kNvwFnuF4_&_nc_oc=AdqQaGtt71Lajf2wCsdA9Zpog-3k1SFE2vp8cCTABbdtQRax0Lafi6hDgfOkJqZB-rY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af-O5eqojpBWwEgMb9sLEDDg-lWO5j2dt6LoMCVgpl3wKA&oe=6A4281D9"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gr0yPzkj3aYQ7kNvwF1CKwV&_nc_oc=Adp0w9WeWcvWbpvnkPwD0WN8If_UvqX4S1iUGKFclMb-Jo-eUnQZfLADQeBDXgbv7qQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af97VI-gdgg4RXEI82eu1v7AxXa_Lp3NEGAQ60CapjPt2w&oe=6A428A96"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XrFQPEc3zW0Q7kNvwH1Hpih&_nc_oc=AdozJqlYdS9VmVZqIfK2hshVsJ3HYCzBXaxj8WVmNkT4YW-ZD-uuwTndgW_polkqbdo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af86WDRk4LYOquAqM2dsiMbjg4VU3cbnX0z9M0sJ8tuILw&oe=6A4286B1"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip